## 1. SQL Injection

### ❌ VULNERABLE CODE
```javascript
app.get('/user/:id', (req, res) => {
  const id = req.params.id;
  // VULNERABLE: Direct string concatenation!
  const query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${id}`;
  db.query(query, (err, result) => {
