2. Implement comprehensive error handling
3. Add logging and monitoring
4. Add CORS configuration
5. Setup pre-commit hooks

---

## 🔧 Recommended Dependencies

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "express": "^4.18.0",
    "helmet": "^7.0.0",
    "express-validator": "^7.0.0",
