| **Error Handling** | ❌ Exposes stack trace | ✅ Safe messages | Prevents information disclosure |
| **Logging** | ⚠️ Console only | ✅ Structured logging | Better monitoring & debugging |
| **HTTPS** | ❌ None | ✅ Supported | Data encryption in transit |
| **Pagination** | ❌ Not implemented | ✅ Implemented | Prevents data enumeration |
| **Response Format** | ⚠️ Basic | ✅ Structured | Better API consistency |

