---

## Remediation Priority

| Priority | Issue | Time to Fix |
|----------|-------|------------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | Rotate all exposed credentials | Immediate (< 1 hour) |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | Remove `.env.test` from git history | Today (use `git filter-branch` or `BFG`) |
| 🟡 HIGH | Add helmet security headers | 1-2 hours |
| 🟡 HIGH | Add input validation | 2-3 hours |
